## Super Quick Linked List Insertion Revision

| # | Insertion Type | Operation / Key Idea | Time Complexity | Space Complexity |
|---|---------------|----------------------|-----------------|------------------|
| 1 | Insert at Beginning | `newNode->next = Head` <br> `Head = newNode` | O(1) | O(1) |
| 2 | Insert at End (Using Tail) | `Tail->next = newNode` <br> `Tail = newNode` | O(1) | O(1) |
| 3 | Insert at End (Without Tail) | Traverse list until last node <br> `last->next = newNode` | O(n) | O(1) |
| 4 | Insert at Particular Position | Move to `(pos - 1)` node <br> `newNode->next = temp->next` <br> `temp->next = newNode` | O(n) | O(1) |
| 5 | Insert using Recursion | Recursively create nodes <br> `node->next = recursive call` | O(n) | O(n) |
